no conto di avere molto più in comune di questa lezione di ballo. La coesione all'interno dei detenuti della riabilitazione cresce, ma quando il passato di Bex li raggiunge di nuovo, tutto è in pericolo."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Bex has caused a serious accident and is therefore in prison. In order to rehabilitate the inmates, the prison offers them a dance class led by Ava. But Bex doesn't want to take part. However, she has no other choice and soon she feels drawn to Jay in particular and they realize that they have much more in common than this dance class. The cohesion within the prisoners of rehabilitation grows, but when Bex's past catches up with them again, everything is in danger."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Die 20-jährige Bex hat einen folgenschweren Unfall verursacht und sitzt deswegen im Gefängnis. Um die Insassen zu resozialisieren, bietet die Haftanstalt für sie einen Tanzkurs an, der von Ava geleitet wird und die sogenannten „Resis“ zu einem Tanzteam zusammenschweißen soll"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7x6ZojKoKggTjtsGVy20rNfmcEY.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/285yLIbKERMFLHXEhpKN0cVlEqM.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":842424,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7x6ZojKoKggTjtsGVy20rNfmcEY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7x6ZojKoKggTjtsGVy20rNfmcEY.jpg","language":"it","width":596,"height":847},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7x6ZojKoKggTjtsGVy20rNfmcEY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7x6ZojKoKggTjtsGVy20rNfmcEY.jpg","language":"it","width":596,"height":847}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"de":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.o